  "description": "After being reborn, all Litia wants is a quiet career training dragons. But when Duke Albarant’s temperamental dragon chooses her as its trainer, she's faced with an unexpected offer. She tries to refuse the persistent duke, but that's easier said than done when he never takes no for an answer. A dragon’s choice, a duke’s determination, and one very reluctant heroine—can Litia hold onto the peaceful life she's dreamed of, or will this second chance demand far more than she's ever bargained for? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
